        <!--
          No published releases yet. `scripts/release.sh` appends a signed <item>
          here per release. Before the first real auto-update works you must:
            1. Generate a Venice Sparkle EdDSA keypair (Sparkle bin/generate_keys),
               store the private key in the login keychain, and set SUPublicEDKey
               in Info.plist to the new public key.
            2. Build + notarize with a Venice Apple Developer ID (see scripts/bundle.sh
               SIGNING_IDENTITY / NOTARY_PROFILE).
            3. Publish the DMG as a GitHub Release on this repo.
          Until then this channel is intentionally empty, so the in-app updater
          never offers a bogus update.
        -->
    </channel>
